        "created_at": "2020-09-11T21:13:31.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Hi, I have been playing spirit island for awhile and won against adversaries up to level 8. I am trying out the Jagged Earth Scenarios and Varied Terrains has kicked my butt. Maybe I have gotten unlucky but does anyone else have any thoughts on the difficulty and a good combo to take on this scenario besides the spirit listed.</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:54:16.932Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
